            <ArticleTitle>[Abdominal pregnancy. Clinical case in surgical emergncy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>157-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A clinical case of abdominal pregnancy observed during emergency laparotomy in a woman suffering for acute abdominal pain, is described. The difficulty of an ectopic pregnancy diagnosis and the catastrophic consequence of an missing diagnosis are underlined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
